'''Berserkory''' (バトルコアラッキョ, ''Batoru Koarakkyo'', '''Battle Koalakkyo''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] variant of [[Kory]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

