==Trivia==
*[[Three Evil Brothers]] implies that Berserkory, [[Kory]] and [[Koronium]] are brothers.
*His axe is the same as [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]]'s, only bloodstained.
**In his Japanese description, he was freeloading at the house of Axe Cat, rather than an unnamed narrator. Their Japanese names also match: Axe Cat is named Battle Cat while Berserkory is named Battle Koalakkyo.
**The stage [[Sunset's Howl]] may also refer to how Berserkory awakened his powers.
*Excluding [[:Category:Animated Enemy Bases|animated enemy bases]], Berserkory has the highest [[Wave Attack]] level of any enemy.

